# Q27 What is a Named KPI, as a concept, before anyone computes it? A measure definition with a name, a definition and a kind, and no value.
PREFIX kpi: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/>
PREFIX kind: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure-kind/>
PREFIX measure: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?measure ?name ?definition ?kind WHERE {
  ?measure a kpi:MeasureDefinition ; skos:prefLabel ?name ; skos:definition ?definition ; kpi:measureKind ?kind .
}
